<!-- No Tomorrow icon set. Hand-authored 24dp vectors (Material-Symbols-style
     geometry). Never traced from SF Symbols. Tinted by NtIcon().

     Today is the selected tab, so the reference renders the filled house: a
     chevron roof stroke with a chimney stub on the right slope, and a SOLID body
     below it (hairline-separated from the roof) carrying a knocked-out door.
     The old two-stroke outline had neither door nor chimney and no fill.
     Geometry measured on design/ios26-reference/01b-tabbar-crop-2x-smooth.png. -->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="24dp"
    android:height="24dp"
    android:viewportWidth="24"
    android:viewportHeight="24">
